{"results":[{"rowIndex":236,"group":"6","grade":3,"candidate":"C6","reason":"The before relation attaches to Order rather than the labeling request, and n3 is not coherently linked to the shape.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":236,"group":"7","grade":7,"candidate":"C7","reason":"It preserves labeling before export but does not link the target text Order placed to the label.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":236,"group":"8","grade":3,"candidate":"C8","reason":"It links Order to labeling, but treats te as a verb particle and leaves placed detached from Order.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":237,"group":"0","grade":7,"candidate":"C0","reason":"The huge pale earring is present but has no relation to the changed star.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":237,"group":"3","grade":8,"candidate":"C3","reason":"An imperative changes a star earring described as huge and pale.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":237,"group":"4","grade":3,"candidate":"C4","reason":"It changes a star and makes the huge pale earring an apposition, rather than the object being a star earring.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":237,"group":"5","grade":3,"candidate":"C5","reason":"The huge pale earring is apposed to the star instead of forming the changed noun phrase.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":237,"group":"6","grade":3,"candidate":"C6","reason":"The nominal modifier link puts the star and earring in the wrong head relationship.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":237,"group":"8","grade":3,"candidate":"C8","reason":"It makes huge a result of changing the star, though huge describes the earring.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":238,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Move the tree down by exactly three hand-widths, with just retained.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":238,"group":"6","grade":8,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Move the tree down by exactly three hand-widths, with just retained.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":238,"group":"7","grade":3,"candidate":"C7"